1dwz|n|The last letter of the Greek alphabet. See Alpha. ; The last; the end; hence, death.	n:ltw,72,4;1wcr,49,3~ltw,72,4;1wcr,49,3
1dxe|n|The act of omitting; neglect or failure to do something required by propriety or duty. ; That which is omitted or is left undone.	a:1dj8,59,3~1dj8,59,3
